{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-03-11 08:07:00', 'title': 'HII NAMES PAUL C. HARRIS AS CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY AND COMPLIANCE OFFICER', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., MARCH 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- GLOBAL ENGINEERING AND DEFENSE TECHNOLOGIES PROVIDER HII (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT PAUL C. HARRIS HAS BEEN APPOINTED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY AND COMPLIANCE OFFICER, REPORTING DIRECTLY TO HII PRESIDENT AND CEO CHRIS KASTNER ON MATTERS OF SUSTAINABILITY.'}